ragon"]},{"code":401,"indent":1,"parameters":["skin who would say exactly what you just said, and that your question is more or less what you would call a"]},{"code":401,"indent":1,"parameters":["'lucky guess' - am I right?\""]},{"code":357,"indent":1,"parameters":["TJS_AltMenus","Show BattleBG","Show BattleBG",{}]},{"code":117,"indent":1,"parameters":[22]},{"code":101,"indent":1,"parameters":["",0,1,2,"\\P[1]"]},{"code":401,"indent":1,"parameters":["\"Um...  Yeah...  Actually, yes...\""]},{"code":357,"indent":1,"parameters":["TJS_AltMenus","Hide BattleBG","Hide BattleBG",{}]},{"code":101,"indent":1,"parameters":["Women 2",1,1,2,"Witch"]},{"code":401,"indent":1,"parameters":["\"In that case, I know *EXACTLY* what to do with you!  I am going to set you up with some things that will help you, and it won't"]},{"code":401,"indent":1,"parameters":["cost you anything, or hurt you or have any tradeoff or anything, and you won't suffer any other 'catch' of any kind, honest!"]},{"code":401,"indent":1,"parameters":[""]},{"code":401,"indent":1,"parameters":["I just need you to climb onto this operating table over here to my right, hooked up to this machine and this magi-nuclear reactor...\""]},{"code":357,"indent":1,"parameters":["TJS_AltMenus","Show BattleBG","Show BattleBG",{}]},{"code":117,"indent":1,"parameters":[22]},{"code":101,"indent":1,"parameters":["",0,1,2,"\\P[1]"]},{"code":401,"indent":1,"parameters":["\"Um...  Well gosh, what could go wrong?  Ya know?  How am I going to know-\""]},{"code":357,"indent":1,"parameters":["TJS_AltMenus","Hide BattleBG","Hide BattleBG",{}]},{"code":111,"indent":1,"parameters":[0,4,0]},{"code":101,"indent":2,"parameters":["Women 2",1,1,2,"Witch"]},{"code":401,"indent":2,"parameters":["\"Your girlfriend can hang onto your head, keeping it safe in her arms, while I work on your body, which is the only part I need.  So,"]},{"code":401,"indent":2,"parameters":["worst-case-scenario, you only lose your body, and your head can grow a new one.  Fair enough?\""]},{"code":357,"indent":2,"parameters":["TJS_AltMenus","Show BattleBG","Show BattleBG",{}]},{"code":117,"indent":2,"parameters":[22]},{"code":101,"indent":2,"parameters":["",0,1,2,"\\P[1]"]},{"code":401,"indent":2,"parameters":["\"Well, okay, I can see how that would work...  Okay, let's see what this does, whatever it is...\""]},{"code":231,"indent":2,"parameters":[3,"Cstna holding D's head 1",0,0,624,8,50,50,255,0]},{"code":117,"indent":2,"parameters":[18]},{"code":101,"indent":2,"parameters":["",0,1,2,"\\P[1]"]},{"code":401,"indent":2,"parameters":["From your head, you watch your decapitated body climb onto the table and lie down face up."]},{"code":401,"indent":2,"parameters":[""]},{"code":401,"indent":2,"parameters":["\"Okay, do what you're gonna do with it...  I can always grow a new body...\""]},{"code":250,"indent":2,"parameters":[{"name":"- sword-hit 1","volume":90,"pitch":100,"pan":0}]},{"code":230,"indent":2,"parameters":[40]},{"code":250,"indent":2,"parameters":[{"name":"- sword-hit 1","volume":90,"pitch":100,"pan":0}]},{"code":230,"indent":2,"parameters":[20]},{"code":250,"indent":2,"parameters":[{"name":"- sword-hit 1","volume":90,"pitch":100,"pan":0}]},{"code":230,"indent":2,"parameters":[60]},{"code":250,"indent":2,"parameters":[{"name":"- sword-hit 1","volume":90,"pitch":100,"pan":0}]},{"code":231,"indent":2,"parameters":[3,"Cstna holding D's head 2",0,0,576,8,50,50,255,0]},{"code":101,"indent":2,"parameters":["",0,1,2,""]},{"code":401,"indent":2,"parameters":["With well-skilled cuts and slices, which the witch has likely been practicing and preparing for her entire life until now, the witch chops"]},{"code":401,"indent":2,"parameters":["up your body into large pieces, and then cuts into your insides, scooping them out, separating your skin from the rest of your flesh on"]},{"code":401,"indent":2,"parameters":["the operating table."]},{"code":401,"indent":2,"parameters":["You watch as she then puts your body's skin, neck to toe, into